================================================================================
EXERCISE 2: GIT IGNORE - LAB EXECUTION LOG
================================================================================

Step 1: Environment & Repository Setup
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Initialize repository in code directory:
   $ git init
   Initialized empty Git repository in Ex2_GitIgnore/code/.git/

2. Create sample files and log folder:
   $ "Main application file." | Out-File -FilePath main.txt
   $ "Application runtime log entry." | Out-File -FilePath app.log
   $ New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path log
   $ "Server error log entry." | Out-File -FilePath log/server.log

Step 2: Check Initial Status (Before .gitignore)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ git status
On branch master
No commits yet

Untracked files:
  (use "git add <file>..." to include in what will be committed)
	app.log
	log/
	main.txt

nothing added to commit but untracked files present

Step 3: Create .gitignore File
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Contents of .gitignore:
  *.log
  log/

Step 4: Verify Status After Adding .gitignore (Verification)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ git status
On branch master
No commits yet

Untracked files:
  (use "git add <file>..." to include in what will be committed)
	.gitignore
	main.txt

nothing added to commit but untracked files present

Explanation:
  `app.log` and the `log/` folder are ignored by Git as specified in `.gitignore`.

Step 5: Commit and Final Status Check
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Stage and commit:
   $ git add .gitignore main.txt
   $ git commit -m "Add .gitignore and main.txt to repository"
   [master (root-commit) 75695c1] Add .gitignore and main.txt to repository
    2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

2. Final status check:
   $ git status
   On branch master
   nothing to commit, working tree clean

